---
import { GENTLE_INVITATION } from '../../functions/_lib/ai-companions';
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="ai-runtime" data-ai-runtime data-compact={compact ? "true" : undefined} aria-label={compact ? "Ask my AI" : "My AI"} aria-busy="true">
  {!compact && <a name="my-ai" aria-hidden="true"></a>}
  <header class="ai-runtime__header">
    <div><p class="ai-runtime__kicker">{compact ? "SHWA" : "MY AI · OWNER PILOT"}</p><h2>{compact ? "A little curiosity?" : "Your AI, here with you."}</h2></div>
    <span class="ai-runtime__badge" data-runtime-badge>Checking…</span>
  </header>
  <p class="ai-runtime__intro">Pair your computer once, sign in through its native AI client, then try one useful task from PointCast.</p>
  <p class="ai-runtime__pilot"><strong>Runs while your companion is open on this computer.</strong> This pilot is not cloud-hosted. Provider credentials stay in the native client on your computer.</p>
  <output class="ai-runtime__status" data-runtime-status aria-live="polite">Checking your private AI connection…</output>

  <p class="ai-runtime__manage"><a href="/me#my-ai">Manage AI connection ↗</a> · One text task at a time.</p>
  <details class="ai-runtime__pair" data-runtime-pair-details open>
    <summary>Pair a computer</summary>
    <p>Complete the <a href="https://github.com/mhoydich/pointcast/blob/main/docs/setup/ai-runtime.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">one-time companion setup ↗</a>, then create a pairing code here.</p>
    <form data-runtime-pair-form>
      <label>Computer name<input name="label" value="My computer" maxlength="64" required autocomplete="off" /></label>
      <button type="submit" data-runtime-invite disabled>Create pairing code</button>
    </form>
    <div class="ai-runtime__pair-code" data-runtime-pair-code hidden>
      <label>1. Run this command from your PointCast source folder<textarea readonly rows="2" data-runtime-command aria-label="Companion pairing command"></textarea></label>
      <button type="button" data-runtime-copy>Copy command</button>
      <label class="ai-runtime__private-code">2. Paste this private code into the waiting terminal<textarea readonly rows="2" data-runtime-code aria-label="Private one-use pairing code" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label>
      <button type="button" data-runtime-copy-code>Copy private code</button>
      <p>After pasting, press Enter, then Control-D on the empty line. Leave the companion running and return here.</p>
      <p data-runtime-pair-expiry></p>
      <p>Keep this one-use code private. It is separate from the command so it stays out of shell history.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <div class="ai-runtime__connection" data-runtime-connection hidden>
    <div class="ai-runtime__fields">
      <label>Your computer<select data-runtime-select aria-label="Paired computer"></select></label>
      <label>Your AI<select data-runtime-provider aria-label="Native AI provider"><option value="codex">ChatGPT · Codex</option><option value="claude">Claude · Claude Code</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-runtime__facts"><p data-runtime-presence></p><p data-runtime-provider-status></p></div>
    <div class="ai-runtime__actions">
      <button type="button" data-runtime-login disabled>Sign in to your AI</button>
      <button type="button" data-runtime-refresh>Check status</button>
      <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-runtime-disconnect>Disconnect computer</button>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-runtime__login" data-runtime-login-panel hidden>
      <p>Finish the native provider sign-in. Pairing this computer alone does not sign in to your AI.</p>
      <a data-runtime-login-link target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>Open provider sign-in ↗</a>
      <p data-runtime-login-code hidden></p>
      <p data-runtime-login-expiry></p>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-runtime__shwa" data-runtime-shwa>
      <p>Choose one to ask Shwa, or write your own.</p>
      <div class="ai-runtime__starters">
        <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-ai-starter="song" data-ai-quick disabled><strong>History of this song</strong><span data-ai-song-label>The song playing now</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-ai-starter="activity" data-ai-quick disabled><strong>Something to do</strong><span>Three small adventures</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-ai-starter="surprise" data-ai-quick disabled><strong>Surprise me</strong><span>A good little detour</span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="ai-runtime__hint" data-ai-starter-status role="status"></p>
    </div>
    <details class="ai-runtime__invite">
      <summary>Invite Mike to this page</summary>
      <p>Prepare a note with this page’s room link. It goes to the public PointCast inbox only after you review and send it. Your private AI replies are not included. This does not send an email notification.</p>
      <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-ai-invite>Review invitation to Mike</button>
    </details>
    <form class="ai-runtime__task" data-runtime-task-form>
      <h3>Try one useful thing.</h3>
      <label class="ai-runtime__model">Model<select data-runtime-model name="model" disabled><option value="">Waiting for your AI</option></select></label>
      <p class="ai-runtime__hint" data-runtime-model-source></p>
      <label class="ai-runtime__question">What would you like?<textarea name="prompt" rows="3" maxlength="4000" required data-runtime-prompt>Help me choose a quiet PointCast experience for this evening. Explain your choice and ask me one good question.</textarea></label>
      <div class="ai-runtime__voice" data-ai-voice>
        <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-ai-dictate>Tap to speak</button>
        <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-ai-read>Read reply aloud</button>
        <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-ai-stop>Stop voice</button>
        <p class="ai-runtime__hint">Your browser’s speech service may process audio. Review the transcript before sending. Spoken replies use your browser’s voice.</p>
        <p class="ai-runtime__hint" data-ai-voice-status role="status"></p>
      </div>
      <label class="ai-runtime__followup"><input type="checkbox" data-runtime-followup /> Include the last AI reply for a follow-up</label>
      <label class="ai-runtime__page"><input type="checkbox" data-runtime-page /> Include this page’s title, link and description</label>
      <label class="ai-runtime__context">Optional PointCast context<select name="context" data-runtime-context><option value="">No added context</option><option value="elemental-shrine">Elemental Shrine · stone, light, fire, water</option><option value="open-road">Open Road · one minute of stillness</option></select></label>
      <label class="ai-runtime__note">Optional note<textarea name="note" rows="2" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Something you want your AI to know for this task" data-runtime-note></textarea></label>
      <label class="ai-runtime__gentle"><input type="checkbox" name="gentle" data-runtime-gentle /> Invite a gentler experience for this task</label>
      <details class="ai-runtime__gentle-detail"><summary>Read the optional preference</summary><p>{GENTLE_INVITATION}</p></details>
      <div class="ai-runtime__preview">
        <h4>What your AI will receive</h4>
        <p>This task shares only the text below and your optional preference. It does not automatically fetch these links or read private accounts.</p>
        <pre data-runtime-preview></pre>
        <p class="ai-runtime__hint" data-runtime-gentle-preview hidden>{GENTLE_INVITATION}</p>
        <p class="ai-runtime__hint" data-runtime-count>0 / 4,000 characters</p>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" data-runtime-run disabled>Run this task</button>
    </form>
    <div class="ai-runtime__job" data-runtime-job hidden>
      <p data-runtime-job-status aria-live="polite"></p>
      <button type="button" class="ai-runtime__secondary" data-runtime-cancel hidden>Cancel</button>
    </div>
    <section class="ai-runtime__result" data-runtime-result hidden aria-label="Your AI result">
      <h3 data-runtime-result-title>Your AI’s response</h3><p class="ai-runtime__hint" data-runtime-result-model></p><pre data-runtime-result-text></pre>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="ai-runtime__hint">A paired computer, a provider sign-in, and a successful task are separate steps. The optional visit receipt below is a different feature.</p>
</section>

<script>
  import { mountAiRuntime } from '../lib/auth/ai-runtime-ui';
  type RuntimeWindow = Window & { __pointCastRuntimeCleanup?: () => void; __pointCastRuntimeInstalled?: boolean; __pointCastRuntimeRoots?: HTMLElement[] };
  const runtimeWindow = window as RuntimeWindow;
  function initializeRuntime() {
    const roots = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-ai-runtime]')];
    const previous = runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeRoots;
    if (previous && roots.length === previous.length && roots.every((root, index) => root === previous[index])) return;
    runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeCleanup?.();
    const cleanups = roots.map((root) => mountAiRuntime(root));
    runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeRoots = roots;
    runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeCleanup = () => {
      cleanups.forEach((cleanup) => cleanup());
      runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeRoots = undefined;
      runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeCleanup = undefined;
    };
  }
  if (!runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeInstalled) {
    runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeInstalled = true;
    document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initializeRuntime);
    document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => runtimeWindow.__pointCastRuntimeCleanup?.());
  }
  initializeRuntime();
</script>

<style>
  .ai-runtime__manage, .ai-runtime__page, .ai-runtime__shwa, .ai-runtime__voice, .ai-runtime__followup, .ai-runtime__invite { display: none !important; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] { margin: 0; padding: 18px; border: 0; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__invite { display: block !important; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__shwa, .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__voice { display: block !important; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__followup { display: flex !important; gap: 9px; align-items: center; }
  .ai-runtime__starters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .ai-runtime__starters button { padding: 7px 9px; font-size: 12px; min-height: 38px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__manage { display: block !important; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__page { display: flex !important; gap: 9px; align-items: center; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__intro,
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__pair,
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__note,
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__context,
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__facts,
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__task > h3,
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] [data-runtime-disconnect],
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] > .ai-runtime__hint { display: none !important; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] h2 { font-size: 25px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__task { margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 16px; gap: 12px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__pilot { padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 12px; }

  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__starters { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__starters button { text-align: left; display: grid; gap: 5px; padding: 13px; border-color: #c4ceb9; background: #fffef8; color: #263c2c; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__starters button:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; background: #eaf1df; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__starters strong { font-size: 14px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__starters span { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__starters button:hover { border-color: #658453; background: #eaf1df; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] [data-ai-starter-status]:empty { display: none; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__connection { margin-top: 12px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__task { border: 0; padding: 0; margin-top: 14px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__question { font-size: 12px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__question textarea { min-height: 72px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__options { border-top: 1px solid #d5deca; padding-top: 12px; margin: 0; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__options > :not(summary) { margin-top: 14px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__result { margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 16px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__result h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__result pre { font: 14px/1.65 var(--pc-font-sans, sans-serif); }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"][data-state="ready"] > .ai-runtime__status,
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"][data-state="verified"] > .ai-runtime__status { display: none; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__preview { padding: 10px; }
  .ai-runtime[data-compact="true"] .ai-runtime__options .ai-runtime__pilot { display: block; }

  .ai-runtime { margin: 24px 0; padding: clamp(20px, 4vw, 34px); border: 1px solid #9db1a2; background: #f8faf2; color: #233329; }
  .ai-runtime [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .ai-runtime__header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
  .ai-runtime__kicker, .ai-runtime__badge { margin: 0; font: 700 10px/1.5 var(--pc-font-mono, monospace); letter-spacing: .07em; }
  .ai-runtime__badge { padding: 7px 10px; background: #e7eddc; border: 1px solid #afbea4; }
  .ai-runtime h2 { margin: 7px 0 0; font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .ai-runtime h3 { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 23px; }
  .ai-runtime p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .ai-runtime a { color: #235c49; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-runtime__pilot { padding: 13px 16px; border-left: 3px solid #608249; background: #edf2e1; }
  .ai-runtime__status { display: block; min-height: 1.6em; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .ai-runtime details { margin: 12px 0; font-size: 13px; }
  .ai-runtime summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 650; }
  .ai-runtime__pair { border-block: 1px solid #cbd4c0; padding: 16px 0; }
  .ai-runtime__pair form, .ai-runtime__fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: end; }
  .ai-runtime label { display: grid; min-width: 0; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 650; }
  .ai-runtime input:not([type='checkbox']), .ai-runtime select, .ai-runtime textarea { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-width: 0; padding: 11px; border: 1px solid #a1b2a1; border-radius: 3px; color: #20382a; background: #fff; font: inherit; }
  .ai-runtime textarea { resize: vertical; line-height: 1.5; }
  .ai-runtime button { min-height: 44px; padding: 11px 16px; border: 1px solid #30543b; border-radius: 3px; background: #30543b; color: #fff; font: 650 13px/1.4 var(--pc-font-sans, sans-serif); cursor: pointer; }
  .ai-runtime button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }
  .ai-runtime .ai-runtime__secondary { background: transparent; color: #30543b; }
  .ai-runtime__connection { margin-top: 24px; }
  .ai-runtime__actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 14px 0; }
  .ai-runtime__facts p { margin: 8px 0; }
  .ai-runtime__login, .ai-runtime__pair-code { margin: 18px 0; padding: 18px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #b4c2ab; }
  .ai-runtime__pair-code button { margin-top: 10px; }
  .ai-runtime__private-code { margin-top: 22px; }
  .ai-runtime__task { display: grid; gap: 17px; border-top: 1px solid #cbd4c0; margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 24px; }
  .ai-runtime .ai-runtime__gentle { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .ai-runtime__preview { padding: 17px; border: 1px solid #cbd4c0; background: #fff; }
  .ai-runtime h4 { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .ai-runtime pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; margin: 10px 0; font: 13px/1.65 var(--pc-font-mono, monospace); }
  .ai-runtime .ai-runtime__hint { font-size: 12px; color: #586c5b; }
  .ai-runtime__result, .ai-runtime__job { margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #cbd4c0; }
  .ai-runtime__payments { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 16px; padding: 18px 0; margin-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid #cbd4c0; font-size: 13px; }
  .ai-runtime__payments span { color: #657063; }
  .ai-runtime__payments p { flex-basis: 100%; margin: 0; font-size: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .ai-runtime__pair form, .ai-runtime__fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
